B.a0A=new A.an("How does AI assist with grievance management?","When the AI service is configured and available, it can help classify a complaint, suggest wording, or analyze submitted details. Review suggestions before submitting; AI output is not a decision or guarantee.")
B.a0T=new A.an("Do I need an account?","You need to sign in to submit a grievance or view your grievance history. You can explore this page without an account.")
